    "Dictionary": {
        "Entries": {
            "zh-cn": {
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress":"请求介绍女优",
                "kia_L01": "「人选倒有几个。要看吗？」\n歌音从抽屉里取出名单，摊在桌上。",
                "kia_Q01_op2": "算了",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Select": "招募女优",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_CancelSelect": "暂时不必",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Cancel":"「不合心意？那看别的。」",
                
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade": "%%ErAV_Miyama_lastname%%%%ErAV_Kanade_firstname%%",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade_Intro":"$self.name$翻开歌音递来的名单。第一页是$kanade.name$的照片。\n照片下方是几行简短的评估：\n十五岁。学年成绩首位，教师公认的优等生。性格温顺清秀，有献身倾向。运动天分不足，对流行敏感，容易受周围影响。\n备注栏里只有一行字——「本人自愿。」",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade_Monologue":"「$self.name$遇到了难处……我得想个办法。」\n「三千万的债。光靠打工的话，两个人怎么都还不清。那个人开的条件，虽然说不出口——可总比什么路都走不通强。」\n「书念得好有什么用。我不像$self.name$那么能干，运动也不行。别的忙帮不上……但是这副身体，也许能。」\n「$self.name$一定会反对的。可是——我已经决定了。就算$self.name$生气，我也会去做。」",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade_Comment":"$kanon.name$合上名单。\n「十五岁，处女，优等生，亲妹妹——这四个条件凑齐的人选，市面上可没处找。」\n「近亲题材的片子从来不缺买家。这层关系，本身就是卖点。」",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade_Choice":"对象：宫间奏\n介绍费：0",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Kanade_Select":"$kanon.name$在名单上勾了$kanade.name$的名字。\n「好。手续我这边处理。等办妥了就把人交给你——往后怎么用，你是监督，自己判断。」",

                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_Jitaku_Sayaka":"%%Jitaku_Katsuragi_lastname%%%%Jitaku_Sayaka_firstname%%",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_JitakuSayaka_Intro":"(first, an objective introduction of Jitaku_Sayaka that MC reads on the document)",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_JitakuSayaka_SelfIntro":"(second, an intro from Jitaku_Sayaka's own pov. must be in-character)",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_JitakuSayaka_Comment":"(3rd, a short comment from Kanon, in-character, on Jitaku_Sayaka)",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_JitakuSayaka_Choice":"(4th, choice screen summarize actress info and required payment)",
                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_JitakuSayaka_Select":"(Kanon respond that she'll make the preparations)",

                "Kanon_IntroduceActress_End": "「想好了再过来。名单不变。」"
            },
            "en-us": {}
        }
    }
}
